## Validation Pipeline

For every generated LogicalQuery:

1. Parse JSON into `LogicalQuery` struct
2. Normalize: set version, datasource_id, model_id
3. Ensure GROUP BY dimensions are in SELECT (`EnsureGroupBySelected`)
4. Reject empty selects
5. Validate all fields exist in semantic model
6. Validate metric aggregation expressions
7. Validate join paths against declared relationships
8. Check permission access for each field
9. Compile to parameterized SQL
10. Run `ReadOnlyChecker` on compiled SQL
11. Optional: dry-run via EXPLAIN
12. Execute with timeout, read-only creds, row limit
13. Log prompt, context, SQL, user, datasource, duration, row count, errors

