| `ai_query_history` | AI prompts, responses, confidence, token usage, cost |
| `few_shot_examples` | Curated NL→LogicalQuery pairs |
| `ai_feedback` | User feedback (correct/wrong/unsafe/ambiguous) |
| `permissions` | Allowed models, denied fields, row filters |
| `eval_runs` / `eval_results` | Golden eval persistence |
| `semantic_context_snapshots` | Publish-time snapshots |

