## Common Tasks

### Adding a New Datasource Driver

1. Create `internal/datasource/<driver>/driver.go` implementing `Driver` interface
2. Create `internal/dialect/<driver>.go` implementing `Dialect` interface
3. Register in `internal/datasource/registry.go`
4. Add introspection queries for schemas, tables, columns, PKs, FKs
5. Add golden SQL tests in `testdata/sql/<driver>/`
6. Add integration test against Docker container

### Adding a New Semantic Model Field

1. Add dimension/metric/join via API (`POST /api/semantic/models/{id}/dimensions`)
2. Ensure `ColumnRef` matches a synced column
3. Add synonyms for Turkish/English business terms
4. Set `IsDisplay` on human-readable label dimensions
5. Publish model (`POST /api/semantic/models/{id}/publish`)

### Extending the AI Prompt

1. Modify `PromptBuilder.Build()` in `internal/ai/prompt.go`
2. Keep prompt under `maxPromptRunes` (budget calculation with `utf8.RuneCountInString`)
3. Filter denied fields from dimensions/metrics before rendering
4. Add new sections before `## User Question`
5. Test with eval suite

### Adding a Filter Operator

1. Add constant to `internal/query/logical.go`
2. Add case in `Compiler.buildFilterPart()` in `internal/query/compiler.go`
3. Add operator to `PromptBuilder` rules section
4. Add operator to `LogicalQuerySchema` in `internal/ai/schema.go`
5. Add golden SQL test

### Running Evaluation

```bash
POST /api/ai/eval/run   # Run golden eval suite
GET  /api/ai/eval/regression  # Check for regressions
```

