## Coding Conventions

- Go, no comments unless asked
- Interfaces for datasource drivers and dialects
- Parameterized queries always, never concatenate values
- Quote identifiers using dialect
- Context timeouts for all DB operations
- Never log secrets or DSNs
- Tests for every compiler feature
- One feature at a time
- `nolint:revive` annotations where `SemanticModel` naming is clearer than `Model`
- Turkish-first descriptions when user base is Turkish

