## Failure Modes to Watch

- LLM inventing columns not in semantic model
- Wrong join path (fanout risk on one_to_many / many_to_many)
- Multiple definitions of revenue or similar metrics
- Missing date filters (no time bounding)
- Wrong timezone on date comparisons
- Incorrect grain (counting rows vs distinct business entities)
- Leaking masked/denied columns through AI prompt
- Generating destructive SQL (blocked by ReadOnlyChecker)
- Querying raw tables outside the semantic model
- Overloading the prompt with irrelevant schema

